{"seq":3,"slug":"regulatory-framework","title":"监管框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/regulatory-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"basel-framework","title":"Basel III/IV 资本框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/regulatory-framework/basel-framework","wordCount":1698,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-risk-regulation","title":"市场风险监管与 FRTB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/regulatory-framework/market-risk-regulation","wordCount":2060,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"counterparty-risk","title":"交对手信用风险与 XVA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/regulatory-framework/counterparty-risk","wordCount":1978,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"监管框架\">监管框架</h1><p>金融风险监管框架为风险管理实践设定了最低标准和约束条件。Basel III/IV 资本框架通过风险加权资产和资本充足率要求，确保银行持有足够资本缓冲。FRTB 从根本上重构了交易账簿市场风险的资本计量方法，引入了预期缺口（ES）替代 VaR。交对手信用风险与 XVA 定价调整则将信用风险、资金成本和资本成本纳入衍生品估值的全生命周期管理。理解这些监管框架对于量化金融从业者既是合规要求，也是深入理解风险定价的关键。</p>\n"}